- MEADOW_STAND_LOCAL: 6.5 m stand line from player_spawn up the left of the trodden path, kept to the strip where the 08→09
  follow lens stays on her right (F7b); per-screen stop by regionGirlStand
- regionGirlStand(accept): the adapter only lets stops whose 08→09 walk keeps O5 (meadowExitExtraM ≤ MEADOW_EXIT_BUDGET_M 0.432 m)
- girlStandUi: tool icons + selection ring / count badge (2/2/4 pt), hint banner at layout.toast.maxWidth x height + shadow;
  framing bonus only with gap ≥ 13 pt; a line wholly behind the camera returns a non-clear stop instead of throwing
- girl-frame / region-landing-hook: 7 portrait screens (+320x568, 768x1024; 1024x768 landscape skipped: portrait-only mini-game),
  independent fixture = GGbot toolbar rects + his r4.1 banner/tray footprints, widest hint measured from the game's strings
  with PopupKit.measure + sizeToast; O5 budget per screen; swap/landing on 7 screens x 2 regions
